      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IT JUST HAPPENS (8) has a strong winning strike-rate over this journey with two wins and a placing from six tries. Below best last time at this track (23.18) in a Rank Limit - Grade 6, finishing a 10 length fourth. Looks the one to beat with even luck. AYESHA BALE (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (22.68) at this track behind Aston Grandeur in a Rank Limit - Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Expected to be in the finish again. RED EYE SAMURAI (2) doesn't win out of turn but looks close to breaking through. Finished second (26.15) at Warrnambool last time making it three minors on end. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Well placed and gets his chance. DOONGALLA PARODY (4) is not to be discarded.",
